**Algorithm Selection Rationale (from `progress.txt`):**
- **A2C**: On-policy actor-critic baseline for direct comparison to PPO; faster per-update, no clipping
- **SAC-Discrete** (Christodoulou 2019): Best fit for RLQAS's sparse-reward discrete problem — maximum entropy objective encourages exploring diverse operator combinations, off-policy replay gives sample efficiency for expensive quantum energy evaluations, twin critics reduce Q-value overestimation bias, automatic temperature tuning

**Rejected:** TD3/DDPG (continuous only), HER (requires goal-conditioned env), Rainbow (sb3_contrib not installed), TRPO (not in SB3, high complexity)

